            		<a href="postings.cgi?action=edit&forum=5&topic=7&postno=1"><img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/edit.gif" border=0></a> &nbsp; <img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/part.gif" border=0> <a href="profile.cgi?action=show&member=Dreym_ElvenBane"><img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/profile.gif" border=0></a>  <a href="mailto:heidilovesyou@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/email.gif" border=0></a> <a href="javascript:openScript('messenger.cgi?action=new&touser=Dreym_ElvenBane',600,400)"><img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/message.gif" border=0></a>  <a href="javascript:openScript('misc.cgi?action=icq&UIN=8986646',450,300)"><img src="http://wwp.icq.com/scripts/online.dll?icq=8986646&img=5" border=0><img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/icq.gif" border=0></a> <img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/part.gif" border=0> &nbsp; <a href="post.cgi?action=replyquote&forum=5&topic=7&postno=1"><img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/images/reply.gif" border=0></a>
    			    <hr size=1 width=100% color=#000000>
            		<font face="tahoma" color=#000000 size=2>
           			Hello. I am Dreym ElvenBane a level 50 healer from Valkjosandi. &nbsp;I have an idea on what i think to be the perfect ally system. &nbsp; I have posted this on the Vn boards and about 200 guilds individually. &nbsp;I wont have time to check back so please post your thoughts on my origional post on the vn board. <br> <br>[Camelot Vault] &nbsp;VN Boards » Camelot US Server Boards » Bors » &nbsp;To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>Logged in as: DreymElvenbane &#0124; Logoff &#0124; Private Messages &#0124; Options &#0124; Help &#0124; Live Chat &#0124; VN Boards TOS &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Previous Active Topic &#0124; Next Active Topic &nbsp; <br>  <br>Author Topic: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>DreymElvenbane  <br>Posts: 139 <br>Registered: Jan 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 5:19pm Subject: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>Well i was going to go to the trouble of posting on each individual one of your boards, but after looking closer there was just too many guilds to post.  <br>I have talked to some of the larger guilds in game but so far i am having a horrible time getting threw what we need to do to fix our emerald alliences to be as suffiant as how the hibs have it. I have done some reasearch so perhaps maybe that will help ya all overall understand it better. Statiscly there is 241 guilds in Midgard. Now some of these guilds have merged or are no longer, but that number is just to give you a general idea. There are 10 guilds in Midgard that have over 90 people in their guild. I concider 90+ to be a somewhat large guild. The idea on makeing one large guild allience i feel is going to hurt Midgard in the long run. The reason being that there is far more small guilds then large guilds. If the large guilds all ally, 2 things will happen. #1 either all or some of the small guilds will be left out of the loop. OR #2 we will be giving individual tells to all the small guilds trying to get them to raids. Both options are not smart ones. Giveing individual tells takes losts of time. And to top that off there are always lots of folks that insist on being anon. Im sure Cilian of all people knows because he is usually the one to be giving everyone 40+ indivual tells. Which in the long run can prevent us from getting where we need to be on time.  <br>I have come up with a more wise suggestion. Each large guild (90+) people pick up the small guilds as allies. The large guilds will have a loop type system. The person that is starting the raid will tell the next large guild in line untill all the large guilds know. The large guilds will relay info in asend so that the small guilds will know about raids imediatly. Thus saving huge amounts of time. We then would make a cg of one officer or gl in each of the 10 large guilds. When info relays threw the chat the large guilds relay the info into asend. And TADA! We now have a system that does work! (Thank you hibernia, i got this idea from you. &nbsp<img src="http://www.crimsonguard.info/ikonboard/emoticons/wink.gif" border="0"> Talk to me in game if your interested in setting this up.  <br> <br>Dreym ElvenBane &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>BudoDude  <br>Posts: 73 <br>Registered: Feb 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 5:25pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>but...... BUT....... my job of messaging everyone 40+....... WHAT WILL HAPPEN TO ME?! &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>DreymElvenbane  <br>Posts: 139 <br>Registered: Jan 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 5:27pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>Gosh i hope middies get this threw your head. I want us to be efficant and successful. &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>BudoDude  <br>Posts: 73 <br>Registered: Feb 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 5:29pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>sounds like a plan......... soooooo....... it will be lik this right?  <br> <br> <br>Pantheon <relays to>: all guilds  <br> <br> <br>? &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>DreymElvenbane  <br>Posts: 139 <br>Registered: Jan 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 5:37pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read - Date Edited: 3/25 5:38pm (1 edits total) Edited By: DreymElvenbane &nbsp; <br>Huh? no.. We would all work together. They system is one big loop....for example my guild sees that our relic is under attack. I would tell pantheon, they would tell the fallen, the fallen would tell Na, etc etc. And the big guilds /asend relic under attack! So instead of playing the game "the telephone", and people showing up hours later, the correct info is relayed in a matter of 5 mins. My system is quick and efficant. &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>DreymElvenbane  <br>Posts: 139 <br>Registered: Jan 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 8:20pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>/bump i want every middy to read.. I would like to start on this right away. &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>troberg  <br>Posts: 76 <br>Registered: Jan 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 9:31pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>i like this idea. i for one don't believe in having all the high levels in one guild. too much ego there for me. This idea tends to sprout more community and less powerhungry status. To be honest, if I'm lead into battle I want to be lead by the people who I know and trust and not by someone I don't know whatsoever. The only hinderance I see here is how does leadership from the larger guilds coordinate and not step over each other. If you can make a 9 large guild satelite that can work together and leave their egos at the door and do whats best for the realm, then I see something really positive.  <br> <br>Ultimately you will trust your own guild more than others. I do not want to be reliant upon one guild to call the shots for everyone. I'd rather see teamwork and cooperation than a aristocracy.  <br> <br>just my 2 cents.  <br> <br>  <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>This_Ismyname  <br>Posts: 2 <br>Registered: Mar 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 10:15pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read &nbsp; <br>step 1) dont name your alliance something gay like the 'emerald alliance' &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>Killarnie  <br>Posts: 235 <br>Registered: Jan 02 <br> Date Posted: 3/25 10:58pm Subject: RE: To all middies please read - Date Edited: 3/25 11:01pm (2 edits total) Edited By: Killarnie &nbsp; <br>Pantheon sends "Relic is under attack at Yggdra, 50 40+ Hibs!" to Guardians of Asgard  <br> <br>Guardians of Asgard sends "Relic is Attached to Yggdra, 40 to 50 Hits" to Fallen  <br> <br>Fallen sends "Relish is added to my yiddish, watch out for the pits" to Asian Dragons  <br> <br>Asian Dragons sends "Rerishi wa, totemo oishi desu ne" to War Dragons  <br> <br> <br> <br> <br>-----signature-----  <br> <br>Killarnie Smallberries - 44 Berserker  <br>Micro Maniacal - 32 Runemaster  <br>Guardians of Asgard - Midgard - Bors  <br>  <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>Rodskagg  <br>Posts: 3 <br>Registered: Feb 02 <br> Date Posted: 12:06am Subject: RE: To all middies please read - Date Edited: 12:07am (1 edits total) Edited By: Rodskagg &nbsp; <br>My opinion is that maybe you should post this in all the guilds forums. Because I know that most people that play dont even come to these boards. They dont even know that these boards exist trust me.=)  <br> <br>Edit: Btw i like you idea very much. &nbsp; <br>Post Reply &#0124; Active Topic Notification &nbsp; <br>  <br>  <br>[Camelot Vault] &nbsp;VN Boards » Camelot US Server Boards » Bors &nbsp; <br>© 2002 Snowball, Inc. (SnowBoards 2.2.245, HNSC4AWEB6) 0.204 &nbsp; <br>  <br> &nbsp;  <br> &nbsp;
